    N0041.outputBudget p N d F W S y ≤ N0041.outputBudget p N d F W T y := by
  unfold N0041.outputBudget N0041.clippedCoefficientBudget
    N0041.reverseCoefficientBudget N0041.expBudget
    N0041.logSourceBudget N0041.correctionBudget N0041.functionalBudget
    N0344.projectionCostBound N0344.tableCostBound
