/-! Numeric factor literals are bounded from the original dense rational input.
The factor is a genuine monic divisor; no factor-finding algorithm is assumed. -/
namespace Internal.N0339.N0197.N0361
open Polynomial Internal.N0048
open scoped BigOperators
