/-!
# Row updates on the slot workspace

`axpyLoop`: for `j < N`, `dst[j] := dst[j] - t * src[j]`, with `t` in slot `2` and slots `3`, `4`
as temporaries.  The rows `dst` and `src` are slot ranges `[dv, dv + N)` and `[sv, sv + N)`.
