/-!
# Pivot search on the slot workspace

Rows of length `N` sit at slots `rowStart N u + j = 5 + N + u * N + j`; slot `0` holds zero.
`pivotLoop` scans columns `i < n` of row `u` with the equality macro and stops at the first
nonzero entry, setting `f = 1` and `pv`; otherwise `f = 0`.  Its result agrees with
`Problem18Elimination20260929.pivot` on the first `n` columns (`pivot_run`, `pivot_of_scan`).
-/

