/-!
# The elimination phase on the slot workspace

With pivot `pv` in row `u` (`v = row u`, `v_pv ≠ 0`), `elimPhase` stores `v_pv⁻¹` in slot `1`
and, for every later row `w < c` and for the residual row `x` (slots `5 .. 5 + N`), replaces
`y` by `y - (y_pv · v_pv⁻¹) · v`, i.e. by `eliminate (observe e) pv v y` (`elim_run`).
