/-  Coefficientwise congruence modulo `m`. -/

def congr (f g : ZPoly) (m : Nat) : Prop :=
  ∀ i, (f.coeff i - g.coeff i) % (m : Int) = 0

/-  Two integer polynomials are coprime mod `p` when they admit a Bezout
combination congruent to `1` modulo `p`. -/














