/-! # Explicit slot values of the intertwiner-scan banks

`query_target_value` and `row_columns_value` evaluate the query and the augmented rows of the
kernel-witness trial banks entry by entry; `banks_of_clauses` turns explicit per-slot clauses into
`Problem18IMPIntertwinerScan20261001.Banks`.  Lead module (Claude), 2026-10-02. -/

