    ∃τ,Run W rawProgram σ τ (10000*(N+1))     ∧     Slots (presentation p) canonical q.WS Sn W τ     ∧    
      (∀i<N,val (presentation p) canonical q.WS τ (r+i)=G.coeff i)     ∧    
      (∀s<Sn,(s< r     ∨     r+N    ≤    s) → val (presentation p) canonical q.WS τ s=val (presentation p) canonical q.WS σ s)     ∧    
